  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十七关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "{@nickname}博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我......我不是......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "霧散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "近衛局發來通訊，他們發現了更多整合運動的蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "說是在跟蹤一個敵人，女性，白髮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "阿米婭，老陳催促我，讓你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——你臉色不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交給我吧",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "那......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "那就交給你了，{@nickname}博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "最好能在五分鐘內出發。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "——{@nickname}博士——"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是在害怕嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "啊......？我......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "博士......我沒有在害怕什麼......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "當然，我害怕，害怕再一次失去......所以才......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "不，我只是不想的......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......難道說，你不喜歡這種力量？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我......我不知道......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我不知道該不該這麼說......但我......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "它不應該光是......傷害別人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我不想讓博士看到我，這麼近的看到我......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "......奪走生命。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，沒有必要後悔。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我沒有後悔。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "不，我是說......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我就是會為了博士而使用力量，無論他背負著什麼，我不後悔殺死他。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "但是，當然......原本，應該會有更好的辦法吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "因為沒能找到那個辦法，所以他死去了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "這一點......我很後悔。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我不希望......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "不希望{@Nickname}你看到這樣的我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "明明說著讓這片大地的感染者從痛苦中脫身......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "關鍵時刻，卻還是要一次又一次的，說服自己，去剝奪感染者的生命。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我真是，太弱了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，至少你保護了我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "——————"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......這是我應該做的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我明白了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我從來都不認為，有什麼事情真的命中註定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "只是，無論如何......無論我會走到哪一步......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我都會保護你的，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我保證。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "不行！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "你們先走！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "我得去......得去把碎骨救回來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "你瘋了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "你這是自投羅網......要去，就大家一起去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "我可不能，不能讓他在這荒野中......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "那就上吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "怎麼會——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "整合運動......折返了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "他們要做什麼——？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "星熊警官！快回撤！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "近衛局，別懈怠！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "準備好防禦對方的攻擊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "掩護！掩護我！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "那個女人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "不行，那個女人的盾，我們是越不過去的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "快！迂回！趁他們還沒反應過來......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "先把碎骨，把碎骨——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "把他搶回來！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "羅德島！他們在轉移目標，你們要注意！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "不好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "星熊警官！小心你的右邊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "——嗯——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "呼呼，用盾擋開了？有些意思——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "爆炸？整合運動的偷襲？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "當然不止是偷襲哦~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "就請你在這裡乖乖待著，別向後去了哦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "嘖——哪來的混蛋！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "又是爆炸！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "阿米婭！我遭到整合運動遠程火力的壓制！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "星熊",
          "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
          "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
          "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
          "text": "其餘的整合運動，正朝你們的方向快速移動！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "唔，這面盾還挺厚實的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "我似乎有點自找麻煩的意思呢......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "算了，就當我幫整合運動一點小忙吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "要讓我看到有趣的事情哦。可別讓我太失望了~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "是切城的那個叫W的人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "難道說，陳長官他們被她甩掉了嗎？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "小心敵人的突襲！迅速援護星熊警官！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "還有很多敵人埋伏在周圍！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "只有暴露他們的蹤跡，我們才能取得優勢！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士！請指揮各小隊應對敵人的襲擊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
